source: apps/auth-service/src/deliveries/email/tests.rs
expression: read
---
Subject: Confirm your email address for your Origin Account

--- text/plain ---
Hello,

Someone, hopefully you, added ada@example.com to the Origin Account @ada. If that is your account, open this link and select "Confirm this address":

https://auth.sourceorigin.dev/settings/emails/verify#token=TOKEN

The link works once, for 24 hours. If you did not add this address, ignore this email: the address will be removed when the link expires.

SourceOrigin

--- text/html ---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Confirm your email address for your Origin Account</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:24px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1a1a1a;background:#ffffff">
<div style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto">
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>Someone, hopefully you, added <strong>ada@example.com</strong> to the Origin Account <strong>@ada</strong>. If that is your account, open this link and select “Confirm this address”:</p>
<p><a href="https://auth.sourceorigin.dev/settings/emails/verify#token=TOKEN" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:8px;background:#1a1a1a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none">Confirm this address</a></p>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:#555555">Or copy this link: https://auth.sourceorigin.dev/settings/emails/verify#token=TOKEN</p>
<p>The link works once, for 24 hours. If you did not add this address, ignore this email: the address will be removed when the link expires.</p>
<p>SourceOrigin</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
